WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.400
In an online session, up to four people work on one project, each on their own computer.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.400
The host chooses File, Online session, Start live session.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:18.600
Type your name. Guests edit only their own tracks, unless you choose Everything.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.000
Click Start. LYNX SHARE makes an invite code for this session.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:29.400
Copy it and send it to your friends, by chat or e-mail.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:35.600
Your friend chooses Join live session, pastes the code and clicks Join.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.400
When someone asks to join, you decide: click Let them in.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:47.200
Your friend now has the project. Every change reaches everyone.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:52.800
Here Leo adds a drum track of his own. It shows up on your screen too.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.400
Press Play to hear both drum tracks.

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:05.000
End live session is in the same menu. Your project stays on your computer.
